WEBVTT

00:13:57.687 --> 00:14:00.310
socially, politically and individually.

00:14:00.334 --> 00:14:04.582
For 100 years now, we've been singing
war songs about addicts.

00:14:04.606 --> 00:14:08.506
I think all along we should have been
singing love songs to them,

00:14:08.530 --> 00:14:12.778
because the opposite of addiction
is not sobriety.

00:14:12.802 --> 00:14:16.633
The opposite of addiction is connection.

00:14:16.657 --> 00:14:18.606
Thank you.

00:14:18.630 --> 00:14:25.630
(Applause)